        "original_id": "9a346331-85ee-5945-b190-5146001a8393",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: AFI\n- People: Davey Havok, Adam Carson, Hunter Burgan, Jade Puget\n- Places: Ukiah, California\n- Discography: studio albums, live albums, compilation albums, video albums, extended plays, singles, music videos\n\nFacts:\n- AFI is an American rock band from Ukiah, California, that was formed in 1991.\n- AFI stands for A Fire Inside.\n- Since 1998, AFI has had the same lineup of lead vocalist Davey Havok, drummer and backup vocalist Adam Carson, bassist Hunter Burgan, and guitarist Jade Puget.\n- Hunter Burgan and Jade Puget both play keyboard and contribute backup vocals in AFI.\n- AFI's discography consists of ten studio albums, one live album, one compilation album, one video album, twelve extended plays, nineteen singles, and fourteen music videos.",
